igami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/monospaced(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/monospaced(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/monospaced(_:)","title":"monospaced(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"monospaced"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}